# AI
# Private, per-developer instructions for Claude in this repo. The tracked
# CLAUDE.md is shared with the whole team; CLAUDE.local.md is personal and must
# never be committed (it would otherwise be untracked-but-not-ignored, the exact
# state that gets swept into `git add -A`).
CLAUDE.local.md
.claude/worktrees/
# Codex/agent scratch artifacts (briefs, run prompts, review transcripts) that
# would otherwise be swept into `git add -A`. Never commit these.
.codex-*
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/agent-memory/
.claude/skills/
.claude/hooks/

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
